          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.504,
            0.723,
            0.525
          ],
          "content": "Referring to Fig. 1.3, answer the following questions:"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.127,
            0.529,
            0.885,
            0.59
          ],
          "content": "(i) If $\\mathrm { D _ { 1 } R _ { 1 } }$ represents the door to Reiaan’s room, how far is the door from the left wall (the y-axis) of the room? How far is the door from the x-axis?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.12,
            0.594,
            0.517,
            0.617
          ],
          "content": "(ii) What are the coordinates of $\\mathbb { D } _ { 1 } \\mathbb { ? }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.618,
            0.885,
            0.681
          ],
          "content": "(iii) If $\\mathtt { R _ { 1 } }$ is the point (11.5, 0), how wide is the door? Do you think this is a comfortable width for the room door? If a person in a wheelchair wants to enter the room, will he/she be able to do so easily?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.684,
            0.884,
            0.727
          ],
          "content": "(iv) If $\\mathrm { B } _ { _ 1 } \\left( 0 , 1 . 5 \\right)$ and $\\mathrm{B_2}(0,4)$ represent the ends of the bathroom door, is the bathroom door narrower or wider than the room door?"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.131,
            0.745,
            0.399,
            0.77
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Think and Reflect"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.782,
            0.854,
            0.822
          ],
          "content": "1. What are the standard widths for a room door? Look around your home and in school."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.152,
            0.825,
            0.812,
            0.846
          ],
          "content": "2. Are the doors in your school suitable for people in wheelchairs?"
        }
      ]
